nd{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, setting ${x}_{3}=0,$ we get  \n\n$$\n{v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ b \\\\ c\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a-b=-2-(-3)=1.$" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380103 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380104 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380105 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380106 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1000 #edb/ref 17592186380107 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1041 "selection" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1104 #edb/ref 17592186380104 13194139536031 true] [17592186380102 1110 #uuid "8cbb3915-06c4-5e06-8676-ed6e4588d8b4" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380103 1034 "2" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380103 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536031 true] [17592186380103 1111 #uuid "dee2faf3-f327-52b2-9d34-17938342ffa2" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380104 1034 "1" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380104 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536031 true] [17592186380104 1111 #uuid "de964161-ac81-5d1a-89e0-ddfffae7210a" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380105 1034 "-3" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380105 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536031 true] [17592186380105 1111 #uuid "3a052655-0c5c-5c15-bae1-69e6bc5ebe20" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380106 1034 "-1" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380106 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536031 true] [17592186380106 1111 #uuid "f2a469c2-c2de-581c-bf01-5e2e5180b03b" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380107 1034 "-2" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380107 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536031 true] [17592186380107 1111 #uuid "0529c034-1735-525f-bc6c-7568ad2591cb" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380108 1017 #edb/ref 17592186380109 13194139536031 true] [17592186380108 1089 "q-110590" 13194139536031 true] [17592186380108 1091 #edb/ref 17